id: pm-beads-zroe
title: Use YAML block indentation for heredoc delimiters
description: "Fix Greptile thread 3889967593 without reopening 3889951963: derive the YAML block content indentation instead of treating every shallower line as a delimiter."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
