severity: high
repro_steps: "Place a near-delimiter body line shallower than the opener but deeper than YAML block indentation, followed by assignment-shaped body text."
resolution: Track YAML block scalar content indentation per line and remove exactly that prefix before applying shell heredoc rules.
expected_result: Only a delimiter exact after YAML block normalization closes an ordinary heredoc.
actual_result: Any shallower delimiter-looking line can close the heredoc prematurely.
